<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink186-kilavi">
       tōḻi kaiyuṟai maṟuttatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       The confidante rejected the gift [from the hero].</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink187">
<l>notuma lāḷar koḷḷā rivaiyē</l>
<l>yemmoṭu vantu kaṭalāṭu makaḷiru</l>
<l>neytalam pakaittaḻaip pāvai puṉaiyā</l>
<l>ruṭalakaṅ koḷvō riṉmaiyiṟ</l>
<l>ṟoṭalaik kuṟṟa cilapū viṉarē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Strange men do not take these [= such flowers].</l>
        <l>Even the girls that bathe in the ocean, having come with me,</l>
        <l>Do not adorn dolls of contrasting foliage of [different hues of] blue waterlilies.</l>
        <l>Because of the absence of those who would take [these flowers] on their bodies,</l>
        <l>[Only] a few flower-sellers have [taken them] for garlands.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
